[{"id":2939307916,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6vMkeM","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?u=f7f8e0273f784f5ec6f6b7fe4a88d449896eb48a&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"I was about to comment that `get_children` will now need to create a copy, but it actually already does because it needs to return an `Array`. Makes sense 😅\r\nAs far as I can see the `CoW` property of children is never used, so `LocalVector` makes more sense.\r\n\r\nNote that `LocalVector` never shrinks, as opposed to `Vector`, so this may start zombying memory. This may not be a problem because it's unlikely a `Node` will be used by adding thousands of children, only to shrink and never have them again. But it's good to keep in mind; we may want to use hysteresis shrinking in later iterations.","state":"APPROVED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107544#pullrequestreview-2939307916","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107544","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107544#pullrequestreview-2939307916"},"pull_request":{